msgid "That GPU node or GPU does not exist, or is on a device you do not have access to."
msgstr "Loo nodi ye-GPU okanye i-GPU ayikho, okanye ikwisixhobo ongenamvume yokufikelela kuso."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU data query could not be added to the device. Check that the plugin's templates are installed."
msgstr "Umbuzo wedatha ye-GPU awukwazanga ukongezwa kwisixhobo. Khangela ukuba iitemplate zeplagini zifakiwe na."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "Isixhobo: isixhobo senodi sacinywa, ngoko ke inodi inokukhubazwa kuphela."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "Isixhobo: khetha isixhobo se-Cacti esikhoyo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "Isixhobo: esi sixhobo sele siyinodi ye-GPU."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "Inodi ye-GPU igciniwe."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "Inodi ye-GPU ayikwazanga kugcinwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "Inodi ye-GPU isusiwe. Isixhobo sayo se-Cacti sishiywe endaweni yaso."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "Inodi ye-GPU ayisuswanga kuba iirekhodi ze-GPU zezayo. Yikhubaze endaweni yoko; iirekhodi ze-GPU azize zicinywe."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "I-GPU ngoku yeyenodi ebonwe kuyo, kunye nembali yayo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "I-GPU ihlala nenodi yayo erekhodiweyo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "I-GPU iya kuphuma kumbuzo wedatha kulwahlulo olulandelayo lwe-index. Iigrafu zayo kunye neefayile ze-RRD ziyagcinwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "Yi-GPU engekho kuphela enokususwa kumbuzo wedatha."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "Ukudala isixhobo kufuna imvume yokulawula izixhobo ze-Cacti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "Inkcazelo: ngenisa ukuya kuthi ga kwiimpawu ezishicilelekayo eziyi-150."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "Igama lomamkeli: ngenisa igama lomamkeli okanye idilesi ye-IP."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "Itemplate yesixhobo ye-GPU Node ayifakwanga."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "Isixhobo asigcinwanga: iakhawunti yakho isenokungaziboni izixhobo ezidalayo. Cela umlawuli ukuba asidale."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "Isixhobo asikwazanga kususwa emva kokuba ufikelelo lwaliwe. Cela umlawuli ukuba asisuse."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "Isixhobo kunye nenodi yaso ye-GPU zadalwa. Misela iisetingi ze-SNMP zesixhobo kwiphepha laso lesixhobo."

