#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Saving adds the GPU data query to the device, with Cacti's automatic reindex turned off: the plugin reindexes after every GPU change. Configure the device's SNMP agent first; see docs/node-setup.md."
msgstr "Ukugcina kongeza umbuzo wedatha ye-GPU kwisixhobo, ukucinywa kwe-reindex ezenzekelayo ye-Cacti: iplagini yenza i-reindex emva kotshintsho ngalunye lwe-GPU. Qwalasela iarhente ye-SNMP yesixhobo kuqala; jonga docs/node-setup.md."

