#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "An absent GPU stays an index of the data query, so its graphs and RRD files stay attached and show a gap. Removing it from the data query stops that: at the next reindex Cacti no longer lists it, its graphs stop updating and its data sources show as orphaned, and its RRD files and graphs are kept until you delete them. The GPU record stays, and the GPU returns to the data query if it is reported again."
msgstr "I-GPU engekho ihlala iyi-index yombuzo wedatha, ngoko ke iigrafu zayo kunye neefayile ze-RRD zihlala zincamathele kwaye zibonisa isikhewu. Ukuyisusa kumbuzo wedatha kumisa oko: kwi-reindex elandelayo i-Cacti ayisayidwelisi, iigrafu zayo ziyayeka ukuhlaziywa kwaye imithombo yayo yedatha ibonakala ingenamsebenzi, kwaye iifayile zayo ze-RRD kunye neegrafu ziyagcinwa de uzicime. Irekhodi ye-GPU iyahlala, kwaye i-GPU ibuyela kumbuzo wedatha ukuba inikwa ingxelo kwakhona."

