#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Consecutive successful collections that must miss a GPU before it is marked absent, from 1 to 100. A failed collection, or one that reports no GPUs, never counts. Absent GPUs keep their records and history and are never deleted automatically."
msgstr "Ukuqokelela okulandelelanayo okuphumeleleyo okufuneka kuphose i-GPU phambi kokuba iphawulwe njengegekho, ukusuka ku-1 ukuya ku-100. Ukuqokelela okungaphumelelanga, okanye okungaxeliyo i-GPU, akubalwa nakanye. Ii-GPU ezingekho zigcina iirekhodi kunye nembali yazo kwaye azisoze zicinywe ngokuzenzekelayo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "GPU Collection"
msgstr "Ukuqokelelwa kwe-GPU"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Iphelelwa Emva"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds after the tool took a sample that its values stop being graphed, from 60 to 86400. An older value is reported as unknown, so a stopped collection shows as a gap, never as a flat line. The GPU age value keeps counting so it can be alerted on."
msgstr "Imizuzwana emva kokuba isixhobo sithathe isampuli apho amaxabiso ayo ayeka ukuzotywa kwigrafu, ukusuka ku-60 ukuya ku-86400. Ixabiso elidala lixelwa njengelingaziwayo, ngoko ukuqokelela okumisiweyo kubonakala njengesikhewu, kungaze kube ngumgca othe tyaba. Ixabiso lobudala be-GPU liyaqhubeka libala ukuze kwenziwe isilumkiso ngalo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina iiTheyibhile ze-Plugin xa uKhupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its node and GPU records. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export them first from GPU Nodes. Cacti devices, data sources, graphs, and RRD files are never touched either way."
msgstr "Xa ikhethiwe, ukususa i-plugin kugcina iirekhodi zayo zenodi neze-GPU. Yisuse uphawu ukuze ukususa i-plugin kuzilahle; zikhuphele kuqala kwi-GPU Nodes. Izixhobo ze-Cacti, imithombo yedatha, iigrafu, kunye neefayile ze-RRD azichukunyiswa nakanye nangayiphi na indlela."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Remove the plugin's Cacti objects on uninstall"
msgstr "Susa izinto ze-Cacti zale plugin xa isuswa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin also removes the GPU device template, data query, data template, and graph templates it imported, each only where nothing outside the plugin uses it, and the GPU data query XML it wrote, only if the file is unchanged. It never deletes RRD files, devices, graphs, or data sources; templates those still use are kept."
msgstr "Xa ikhethiwe, ukususa i-plugin kwakhona kususa itempleyithi yesixhobo se-GPU, umbuzo wedatha, itempleyithi yedatha, kunye neetempleyithi zegrafu ezingenisileyo, nganye kuphela apho kungekho nto ngaphandle kwe-plugin iyisebenzisayo, kunye ne-XML yombuzo wedatha ye-GPU eyibhalileyo, kuphela ukuba ifayile ayitshintshwanga. Ayisoze icime iifayile ze-RRD, izixhobo, iigrafu, okanye imithombo yedatha; iitempleyithi ezo zisazisebenzisayo ziyagcinwa."

